                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Adapt positioning for different customer segments while maintaining the core product message.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Review positioning regularly as customer expectations and market conditions change.</p>
