<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8" align="justify">
                <h3><b>How to Measure Product Marketing Effectiveness</b></h3>

                <p>
                    Measuring product marketing effectiveness helps organizations understand
                    which activities are generating customer interest, engagement, conversion,
                    adoption, and business value. Metrics should be connected to specific
                    product marketing objectives.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Awareness:</b> Measure reach, traffic, impressions, and product visibility among target audiences.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Engagement:</b> Track content interactions, website engagement, campaign participation, and product interest.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Conversion:</b> Monitor leads, trials, registrations, purchases, and other important conversion actions.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Adoption:</b> Evaluate how effectively marketing activities contribute to product usage and customer activation.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Retention:</b> Monitor continued product usage, customer engagement, and renewal behavior.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Business Outcomes:</b> Connect product marketing activities with revenue, customer growth, and overall product performance.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 text-center">
